config INPUT_ANALOG_JOYSTICK
    bool "Analog joystick input driver"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_ANALOG_JOYSTICK_ENABLED
    select ADC
    select INPUT
    help
      Two-axis analog joystick (e.g. a salvaged PS5 controller thumbstick)
      read via ADC and reported as relative mouse-movement input events.
